---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout 
    title="About Lee Gorse | Enterprise Marketing Solution Architect"
    description="Read about Lee Gorse's professional background guiding global brands through complex stack rationalisation and technical design governance."
>
    <Nav />
    <main class="pt-40 pb-24 px-6 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <header class="mb-16">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest specialist-red">The Architect</span>
                <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold mt-4 leading-tight">Lee Gorse: Engineering Revenue Certainty</h1>
            </header>

            <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none space-y-12 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                <section>
                    <p class="text-xl font-semibold architect-charcoal">
                        The Automation Specialist Ltd is a solo strategic consultancy providing enterprise-grade architectural oversight for high-value B2B consultative markets.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-6">
                        In an era of Martech fragmentation, I act as the bridge between high-level business objectives and complex technical ecosystems, working with Marketing and IT departments where technical silos cause operational risk or revenue leakage.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section class="bg-architect-charcoal text-white p-12">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold italic mb-6">Strategic Evolution: The Pivot to High-Touch</h2>
                    <p class="text-white/80">
                        I have intentionally pivoted away from "hands-on-keys" platform configuration. My current and future focus is on <strong>High-Touch Architecture</strong> and <strong>Overall Best Practice</strong>.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-6 text-white/80">
                        I provide the "Success Blueprint" and technical governance rather than the manual build, ensuring that the client's technology investment is structurally sound and aligned with their GTM strategy.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold architect-charcoal mb-8">Consulting Philosophy</h2>
                    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold specialist-red uppercase text-sm mb-2">Process & Data First</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm">I advise on the critical process and data layers that drive revenue, moving beyond simple platform configuration to true solution design.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold specialist-red uppercase text-sm mb-2">Architectural Integrity</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm">To maintain the highest standards, I focus strictly on consultative sales motions, excluding creative services or high-volume B2C retail execution.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-20 border-t pt-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-center justify-between">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold italic mb-2 leading-tight">Ready for Architectural <br/>Oversight?</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-500">Contact Lee Gorse to schedule a discovery audit.</p>
                </div>
                <a href="/contact" class="btn-red px-10 py-4 text-white font-bold rounded-sm whitespace-nowrap">Contact Me</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
    <Footer />
</BaseLayout>